{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_08DE7832","title":"Mala First Metting","entry":"Dlg_08DE7832::entry","exit":"Dlg_08DE7832::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_0705C3A8","articyId":"72057615512910744","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"Thanks for circling back there.","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks for circling back there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44870","byteOffset":31308944,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_2CF5B845","articyId":"72057615512910758","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"While I have you, I was wondering if we could run some stuff up the flag pole and see what sticks?","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"While I have you, I was wondering if we could run some stuff up the flag pole and see what sticks?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40771","byteOffset":29751416,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_59CB1F95","articyId":"72057615512910772","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"I'm sorry, I was told you ran businesses?","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm sorry, I was told you ran businesses?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50574","byteOffset":33474072,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_6F203624","articyId":"72057615512910799","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"Great! So I think it's time we did a SWOT analysis of everything.","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Great! So I think it's time we did a SWOT analysis of everything.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51243","byteOffset":33799048,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_9054539C","articyId":"72057615512910806","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"Ok, I was really hoping you could take the lead on this.","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok, I was really hoping you could take the lead on this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21720","byteOffset":16107464,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_798DBF4A","articyId":"72057615512910821","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"Look, as you can probably tell, traditional schooling is a little below me. My end of year assignment is related to business management, something I already excel at. The sooner I can get it done and out the way, the sooner I can get into the industry.","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, as you can probably tell, traditional schooling is a little below me. My end of year assignment is related to business management, something I already excel at. The sooner I can get it done and out the way, the sooner I can get into the industry.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3350.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31621","byteOffset":19843648,"byteLength":596}},{"id":"DFr_F4D8D6A1","articyId":"72057615512910842","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"Well I hold shares in a number of startups as well as a considerable stake in a holo-hedge-fund that's doing remarkable work in the tax avoidance sector.","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well I hold shares in a number of startups as well as a considerable stake in a holo-hedge-fund that's doing remarkable work in the tax avoidance sector.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32172","byteOffset":20051872,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_8FC475E9","articyId":"72057615512910891","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"Hey, I probably have my ducks in a much neater row than you Noodle Head.","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, I probably have my ducks in a much neater row than you Noodle Head.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26951","byteOffset":18076344,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_5A80AD6D","articyId":"72057615512910898","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mala Spinx","text":"Nothing a little hard graft and weekly performance reviews won't cultivate.","speakerId":"Ntt_45AFF9F2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nothing a little hard graft and weekly performance reviews won't cultivate.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":950.0},"source":{"file"